  "prompt": "flags is some False values followed by some True values (either part can be empty), like a list of builds where every build after the first broken one is also broken. Return the index of the first True, or len(flags) if there is none. Use binary search.\n\nSignature:\n    def first_true(flags: list[bool]) -> int:\n\nExamples:\n    first_true([False, False, True, True]) -> 2\n    first_true([False, False]) -> 2",
